    "synopsis": {
        "native": "L\u00e9a, 27 ans, n\u2019est pas la brillante avocate qu\u2019imaginent ses parents. En r\u00e9alit\u00e9, avec Bertille sa meilleure amie et colocataire, elle a mont\u00e9 une agence proposant de \u00ab louer \u00bb leurs services pour tous types de missions. De ramasseuse de balles \u00e0 fille aimante, de conseill\u00e8re conjugale \u00e0 belle-fille id\u00e9ale, L\u00e9a jongle avec les identit\u00e9s jusqu\u2019\u00e0 s\u2019y perdre elle-m\u00eame. Alors quand son amour de jeunesse r\u00e9apparait et se retrouve m\u00eal\u00e9 malgr\u00e9 elle \u00e0 un de ses mensonges, les choses vont rapidement lui \u00e9chapper\u2026",
        "english": "Twenty-seven-year-old L\u00e9a is not the brilliant lawyer her parents imagined. In reality, with Bertille, her best friend and roommate, she has set up an agency to \"rent\" out their services for all kinds of missions. From picking up balls to being a loving daughter, from marriage counselor to the ideal daughter-in-law, L\u00e9a juggles with so many identities that she no longer knows who she is. When her childhood sweetheart reappears on the scene and finds himself mixed up in one of her lies, things will rapidly get out of hand."
